{"step_index":248,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T18:44:16Z","thinking":"**Verifying `minCard_le` Successfully**\n\nThe `minCard_le` definition underwent verification, resulting in a clean elaboration without errors. The verification employed specific axioms which confirms its validity. The next step involves examining the definition of `romanDominationNumber`.\n\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import Mathlib\\nimport LeanProject.GraphInvariantsComputable\\n\\nopen SimpleGraph\\n\\nlemma exists_min_roman_dominating_function {V : Type*} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] :\\n    ∃ f : V → Fin 3, GraphCalc.IsRomanDominatingFunction G f ∧\\n      GraphCalc.romanWeight f = GraphCalc.romanDominationNumber G := by\\n  let f_two : V → Fin 3 := fun _ => ⟨2, by decide⟩\\n  have hf_two : GraphCalc.IsRomanDominatingFunction G f_two := by\\n    intro v hv\\n    revert hv\\n    decide\\n  have h_nonempty : ((Finset.univ.filter (GraphCalc.IsRomanDominatingFunction G)).image\\n      GraphCalc.romanWeight).Nonempty := by\\n    refine ⟨GraphCalc.romanWeight f_two, ?_⟩\\n    rw [Finset.mem_image]\\n    refine ⟨f_two, ?_, rfl⟩\\n    rw [Finset.mem_filter]\\n    exact ⟨Finset.mem_univ _, hf_two⟩\\n  obtain ⟨m, hm⟩ := Finset.min_of_nonempty h_nonempty\\n  have hmem : m ∈ (Finset.univ.filter (GraphCalc.IsRomanDominatingFunction G)).image\\n      GraphCalc.romanWeight := Finset.mem_of_min hm\\n  rw [Finset.mem_image] at hmem\\n  obtain ⟨f, hf_filt, hfw⟩ := hmem\\n  rw [Finset.mem_filter] at hf_filt\\n  refine ⟨f, hf_filt.2, ?_⟩\\n  unfold GraphCalc.romanDominationNumber\\n  have hget : (((Finset.univ.filter (GraphCalc.IsRomanDominatingFunction G)).image\\n      GraphCalc.romanWeight).min).getD 0 = m := by\\n    rw [hm]\\n    rfl\\n  rw [hget, hfw]\\n\"","Description":"\"Testing exists_min_roman_dominating_function in scratch_test.lean\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_40a99333/scratch_test.lean\"","toolAction":"\"Writing exists_min_roman_dominating_function in scratch_test.lean\"","toolSummary":"\"Write exists_min_roman in scratch\""}}]}
